    {# Course positions (owner, 2026-11-01: "yes, build automatic ranges"): a course arriving with no position takes the
       next free number in its code's range. #}
    {% if course_positions|default(null) %}
    {% embed ui_template('overlay.accordion-section') with {props: ui_props('overlay.accordion-section', {heading: 'Course positions', summary: course_positions.summary, id: 'settings-course-positions', open: settings_open_section|default('') == 'course-positions'})} %}
{% block body %}
		<p>Give each course code prefix the number its range in the catalogue starts at. A course that arrives with no position, added here, imported, or new from a catalogue package, takes the next free number in its code's range, 100 after the highest one in it. With GDN from 1000 and GDN-101 at 1000, a new GDN-102 gets 1100. A course you have given a position is never moved.</p>
		<form action="/admin/settings/course-positions" method="post">
			<input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{ csrf }}">
			{% embed ui_template('data.table') with {props: ui_props('data.table', {caption: 'Position ranges', density: 'compact'})} %}
{% block header %}<tr><th scope="col">Prefix</th><th scope="col">Range starts at</th></tr>{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
			{% for row in course_positions.rows %}
			<tr>
				<td><input class="cl-input" name="prefix[]" value="{{ row.prefix }}" maxlength="20" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Prefix"></td>
				<td><input class="cl-input" type="number" min="1" step="1" name="start[]" value="{{ row.start }}" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Range starts at"></td>
			</tr>
			{% endfor %}
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
			<p class="cl-text-muted">Empty a row to remove its range. Save to add more empty rows.</p>
			{% embed ui_template('form.actions') with {props: ui_props('form.actions', {})} %}
{% block primary_actions %}{{ ui('action.button', {label: 'Save course positions', variant: 'primary', size: 'normal', type: 'submit', icon: 'action-save-changes'}) }}{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
		</form>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
